## Notes: Herbs and ore for gatherers: the node the Interact key would use lights up, in its color when your skill is high enough and red when it isn't (nearby only, up to the game's soft-target range). Every node the guild gathers is saved and shared, and shown on the world map and minimap at any distance. /lm for the commands.
